      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The rapid increase in allergies and asthma in affluent societies stirred an extensive research work looking for clues within the environment. While the results of these efforts continue to unfold, an evolutionary insight might help direct our research agenda and broaden our comprehension of the exposure-disease relationship."},
